  "zh": "# 今日热点聚焦AI算力突破、数据隐私泄露及国际抗议事件。\n## AI 与科技\n- **Run Qwen 3.8 Flash**：展示125B参数模型在RTX 4090上达到100T/s，预示着大模型普及化进程。\n- **Google data center**：因文件删改不当暴露巨额资源消耗，引发对科技巨头能源透明度的关注。\n## 国际视野\n- **日本抗议美国**：反映日美关系紧张，涉及军事基地与贸易摩擦等多重议题。\n- **法国高中生抗议**：学生们对教育改革与气候政策不满，示威规模罕见。\n## 社会民生\n- **孕妇血样外泄**：涉及敏感健康数据非法流出，警示个人信息保护与监管漏洞。\n- **缅北电诈割肾**：揭示跨境诈骗集团残忍敛财手段，亟需国际合作打击。",
  "en": "# Today's highlights: AI breakthrough, data privacy leak, and international protests.\n## AI & Tech\n- **Run Qwen 3.8 Flash**：The 125B-parameter model hits 100T/s on an RTX 4090, signaling a shift toward accessible large‑scale AI.\n- **Google data center**：Improper redaction exposed massive water and electricity use, raising concerns about tech giants' environmental transparency.\n## International\n- **Japan US protests**：Rare demonstrations highlight tensions over military bases and trade issues between the two allies.\n- **French protest**：Students oppose education reforms and climate policies, marking a rare youth mobilization.\n## Society & Livelihood\n- **Blood sample leak**：The illicit transfer of sensitive health data underscores gaps in personal information protection.\n- **Myanmar kidney**：A first‑hand account reveals the brutal tactics of scam rings, urging stronger cross‑border enforcement."
